{"content":[{"c":["AKKUB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of Elioenai’s seven sons and a distant descendant of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.24","r":"1Chr.3.24","rawR":"1Chr.3.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.24","value":"1Chr.3.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Ancestor of a family of Levite gatekeepers who returned to Jerusalem with Zerubbabel after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.42","r":"Ezra.2.42","rawR":"Ezra.2.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.42","value":"Ezra.2.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:42"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.45","r":"Neh.7.45","rawR":"Neh.7.45","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.45","value":"Neh.7.45"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:45"},"). This family name was borne by two of his descendants (#3 and #6 below)."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Descendant of #2 and head of a family of Levite gatekeepers who were among the first to return to Jerusalem after the Babylonian exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.17","r":"1Chr.9.17","rawR":"1Chr.9.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.17","value":"1Chr.9.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Ancestor of a group of temple assistants who returned to Jerusalem with Zerubbabel after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.45","r":"Ezra.2.45","rawR":"Ezra.2.45","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.45","value":"Ezra.2.45"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:45"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Ezra’s assistant who explained to the people passages from the law read by Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.8.7","r":"Neh.8.7","rawR":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.8.7","value":"Neh.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 8:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Descendant of #2 above and head of a family of Levite gatekeepers who lived in Jerusalem during the time of Ezra and Nehemiah (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.19","r":"Neh.11.19","rawR":"Neh.11.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.19","value":"Neh.11.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.25-26","r":"Neh.12.25-26","rawR":"Neh.12.25-26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.25-26","value":"Neh.12.25-26"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:25-26"},"). He is perhaps the same as #5 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Akkub","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.24","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.24","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.24"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:42","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.42","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.42","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.42"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:45","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.45","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.45","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.45"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.17"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:45","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.45","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.45","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.45"},{"anchorText":"Neh 8:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.8.7","rawQueryValue":"Neh.8.7","sourceRefExact":"Neh.8.7"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.19","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.19","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.19"},{"anchorText":"12:25-26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.25-26","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.25-26","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.25-26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"49fcfc0231d4d30c839c8713f71643aca9b316395435b84833a40913f91dcfd9","sourceItemName":"Akkub","sourceItemOrder":228,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Akkub","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Akkub","title":"Akkub","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}